{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32505","headline":"和周繇见嘲 · 段成式","name":"和周繇见嘲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才甘鱼目并，艺怯马蹄间。\n王谢初飞盖，姬姜尽下山。\n缚鸡方角逐，射雉岂开颜。\n乱翠移林色，狂红照座殷。\n防梭齿虽在，乞帽鬓慙斑。\n傥恕相如瘦，应容累骑还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}